# Build-fork ignore list. Binaries never belong in a build repo: decks, documents,
# spreadsheets, PDFs and images are added to Appian by hand in Designer and kept
# out of git (see reference/toolchain.md §8). MCP registration is per machine.
*.pptx
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
.mcp.json
uploads/
scratch/
# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
